它会把目标难度区间定义成：

S0 = before 文件中 p 落在目标区间的 uid 集合
St = after 文件中 p 落在目标区间的 uid 集合
统计这些指标：

retention_ratio = |S0 ∩ St| / |S0|
outflow_count   = |S0 - St|
inflow_count    = |St - S0|
jaccard_overlap = |S0 ∩ St| / |S0 ∪ St|
还会输出：

before_target_count
after_target_count
retained_count
outflow_count
inflow_count
union_count
outflow_ratio_of_before_target
inflow_ratio_of_after_target
jaccard_overlap